{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review maternity guidance for women pregnant after a previous stillbirth",
        "additional_details": "Women who have experienced a previous stillbirth face unique medical and emotional challenges in future pregnancies. I am asking the Government to review maternity guidance so women with a previous stillbirth who present with reduced fetal movements receive care that recognises their history, provides appropriate assessment, and supports personalised decision-making. The aim is to improve care and outcomes for future families.",
        "background": "Review maternity guidance for women with a previous stillbirth who attend hospital with reduced fetal movements, to ensure their previous loss is recognised and they receive appropriate assessment, personalised care and support in subsequent pregnancies.",
